# Keep every text file LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# CHANGELOG.md was entirely CRLF and physicsquiz.cls held 327 CRLF lines among
# 1320, while every other source file is LF. Without this, any tool that
# rewrites a file - latexindent in particular - turns a one-line change into a
# whole-file diff.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gz  binary
